{
  "_comment": "The 10/7/4 board. Band widths were swept against 800 games each: this shape lands 2-3 teams at the Trailhead 88% of the time. Treasure is spread across each band so the field does not all converge on one prize. Themes are arranged so the dark runs inward - the deeper you go the later it gets - and Rain & River appears in every band because the creek runs right through the map. A place has a name, a theme (which is both its trivia subject and what it looks like), whether it is a vantage point, and the treasure lying there. There is no separate terrain layer: the theme is the terrain.",
